WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.340
Episode 22

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.340
Decisive Battle
in the Rainbow Star Cluster<i>!!</i>

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.340
( Air date: Mar 2, 1975 )

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:14.790
Space Battleship

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:14.790
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:22.240
On February 27th, 2200 the space battleship Yamato accepted the challenge...

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:25.660
...from Admiral Domel, the commander
of the Solar System regional operation.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:28.640
To the captain
of the Yamato...

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.240
It's time to settle
this once and for all.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:35.790
We desire Earth, just as much
as you want to go to Iscandar.

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:41.990
If you intend on going to Iscandar,
you must defeat us first in battle.

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:46.290
I propose to you an all out battle in the
Rainbow Star Cluster seven days from today.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.890
From the Commander of the Solar
System Regional Operation, Domel...

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:50.500
...to the captain
of the Yamato.

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:55.640
Meanwhile, the Domel Fleet,
in order to hide from the Yamato...

00:00:55.640 --> 00:01:02.260
...is holding position 30,000 km from the
dark area of the Rainbow Star Cluster.

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:33.640
First, we lure the Cosmo
Zeros away from the Yamato.

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:35.430
Launch the Gamilus Fighters.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:43.050
Carrier 1

00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:43.150
Fighter squadrons, take off.

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:18.850
Carrier 1 Squadron Leader: Getto

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:49.340
Enemy fighters, detected !
All hands, battle stations !

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:51.200
Black Tigers, take off.

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:23.040
Gamilus fighters sighted
above left !  Follow me !

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:54.690
To Carrier 2.
Launch the dive-bombers.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:57.400
Carrier 2

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:13.600
Carrier 2 Squadron Leader: Barger

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:23.900
It's time to show the power of this
Instantaneous Material Transporter.

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:42.720
All planes are inside
the warp beam area.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:43.550
Good.

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:25.790
Gamilus squadrons have
appeared directly above us !

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:26.250
What ?

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:57.650
Damn, where did
they come from ?

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:02.270
Kodai, where are you ?  The Yamato is
being attacked by Gamilus bombers.

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:06.390
It was a trap to lure
the Yamato's fighters away.

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:07.140
Dammit.

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:09.380
Roger.
I'm coming back.

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:16.200
Abort pursuit !  All units, return
to the Yamato at full speed !

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:17.750
Roger.

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:14.840
Alright. To Carrier 3,
launch the torpedo bombers.

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:16.790
The Cosmo Zeros are
occupied by the dive-bombers.

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:18.900
If you come out on the
other side, you'll be safe.

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:23.800
Carrier 3

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:58.650
Torpedo bombers are
in the warp area.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.650
Damn, another surprise attack
from somewhere in space.

00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:03.790
Chief Combat Commander,
please return immediately.

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:06.520
The Yamato is being attacked
from an unknown hyperspace.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:14.700
Turret 1, damaged.

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:26.390
It's time to
finish it off.

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:27.100
To the Battle Carrier...

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:31.000
Battle Carrier

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:34.260
Launch the heavy bomber.

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:48.200
Battle Carrier Squadron Leader: Hidern

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:31.700
My fuel is low.

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:33.500
Alright, let's go
refuel while we can.

00:10:34.880 --> 00:10:36.490
Black Tigers are landing.

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:47.000
All Yamato fighters
were retrieved.

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:49.120
Now is the time.

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:50.500
Go !

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:38.050
What ?
What happened ?

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:44.630
Thank goodness.
It didn't go off.

00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:46.700
No, wait.

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:57.000
Everyone, get out !

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:22.640
Evacuate !  Get out
of the engine room !

00:12:22.640 --> 00:12:23.620
Evacuate !

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:26.670
That's it. If it explodes inside,
the Yamato will blown to pieces.

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:32.540
Analyzer, find the power source.

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:33.070
Aye, sir.

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.500
This is Sanada. I'm in the
engine room of the missile.

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:41.470
I have to reverse the
power to make it back up.

00:12:43.260 --> 00:12:45.800
Fifteen minutes
till the explosion.

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:49.890
Now that the Wave Motion Gun is useless,
the Yamato is no longer a threat.

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:50.990
I'll finish it off.

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:04.630
Heavy bomber has returned.

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:06.620
All ships, advance.

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:07.620
All ships, advance.

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:51.300
Hey, is the
radar repaired yet ?

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:54.340
If the enemy comes out at
a time like this what'll we do ?

00:13:54.780 --> 00:13:58.340
Chief Engineer, did you figure out
how to reverse that drill missile ?

00:13:58.340 --> 00:13:59.840
No, I'm not sure yet.

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:22.190
Battle Carrier,
prepare to attack.

00:14:36.740 --> 00:14:37.750
Commence firing.

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:49.890
Enemy fleet sighted,
forward right.

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:03.700
Have you figured out the drill missile ?
Can't we use the Wave Motion Gun ?

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:05.490
Dammit.

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:24.360
This is it.
I got it.

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:29.530
Set this to reverse.

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:30.260
Aye, sir.

00:15:33.860 --> 00:15:35.340
Turret 2, damaged !

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:37.000
Damn, there aren't any weapons
left to defend the Yamato.

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:39.690
Domel Fleet is approaching !

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:49.980
The Yamato is
completely silent !

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:54.000
Thirty seconds till
the Yamato explodes.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:55.700
Yamato, you fought well.
I praise you.

00:15:59.170 --> 00:16:01.190
That's it.
Connect those cords.

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:05.520
It started.

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:08.490
Alright, it's reversed.
Let's go.

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:23.400
They did it.

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:00.990
What the...
What happened ?!

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:09.710
That's our fleet !
It's been annihilated !

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:12.830
Don't panic, Gale.
The battle isn't lost yet.

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:16.260
When this ship sinks,
so does the Yamato.

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:18.780
Make for the Yamato !

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.700
Hey, it's charging in.

00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:28.800
It must be going to
make a suicide attack.

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:32.200
No, run.

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:34.750
All engines, full thrust.
Starboard full.

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:51.990
It's no good,
it's following us.

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:02.050
Alright, we have no choice.
Enter the dark nebula.

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:15.120
You can't get
away from Domel.

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:17.460
Echo on the sonar.
Yamato detected.

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:21.880
Start bombing.

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:31.340
Bombs !

00:18:32.050 --> 00:18:33.210
Isn't the radar operational ?

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:34.540
No.

00:18:34.540 --> 00:18:36.790
Dammit, we can't do anything.
Where is that bastard ?

00:18:41.460 --> 00:18:44.220
The Yamato is 45 degrees
ahead and above this ship.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:46.000
Stop the attack.

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:48.090
Why did you stop ?

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:51.240
At this rate, we
can't finish the Yamato.

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:53.350
Ready the
self-destruct console.

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:56.230
Self destruct...?!

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:58.100
Set the count to 30 seconds.

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:01.500
This is my
last card, Mr. Gale.

00:19:16.770 --> 00:19:19.320
That Gamilus ship
has gone somewhere.

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:22.000
Maybe they lost us.

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:25.200
No, that Gamilus ship must
know exactly where we are.

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:30.290
Radar repairs complete.

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:35.000
Gamilus ship
directly below !

00:19:52.260 --> 00:19:53.640
Something is appearing
on the screen.

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:08.200
Captain Okita, I'm the Commander of the
Solar System Regional Operation, Domel.

00:20:11.380 --> 00:20:17.200
Commander Domel, I'm the captain of
the space battleship Yamato, Okita Juzo.

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:25.190
I respect your courage,
decisions and wisdom.

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:30.010
Commander Domel, we've been fighting
for each of our home planets.

00:20:30.010 --> 00:20:35.600
However, I don't want any more
casualties.  Let us go to Iscandar.

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:41.550
I can't do that.

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:52.290
Captain Okita, just as you fight for Earth,
I'm fighting for the future of Gamilus.

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:55.930
Even if I die, I can't let
the Yamato reach Iscandar.

00:20:56.300 --> 00:20:57.820
But Commander Domel...

00:20:57.820 --> 00:21:01.930
I'm grateful to have
met a warrior like you.

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:05.710
Glory to the planet
Gamilus and great Earth.

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:13.240
Domel's ship
will self-destruct !

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:16.040
All crew members in the lower decks,
move to the upper decks !  Hurry !

00:21:19.300 --> 00:21:22.140
Closing firewalls
six, seven and eight !

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:23.850
Inject anti-radiation water !

00:22:32.170 --> 00:22:35.990
To all the brave men who risked
their lives and fought for Earth...

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:41.460
Your souls will live within us, and you
will help us build the future of Earth.

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:44.150
We will never
forget you.

00:22:44.150 --> 00:22:45.240
Salute !

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:16.580
Once again, the Yamato has climbed
up from the bottom of a ravine.

00:23:16.580 --> 00:23:18.960
Iscandar is near.

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:22.830
Hurry Yamato, Earth is
waiting for your return.

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:41.040
Goodbye, Earth.{Saraba chikyuu yo}

00:23:41.040 --> 00:23:46.240
A ship is taking off...{Tabidatsu fune wa}

00:23:46.240 --> 00:23:52.340
...it's the space battleship...

00:23:52.340 --> 00:23:57.380
...Yamato.{Uchuu senkan yamato}

00:23:59.640 --> 00:24:07.440
It's about to take off to Iscandar,
carrying the fate of humanity.{Ucyuu no kanata Isckandar he unmei seoi ima tobitatsu}

00:23:59.810 --> 00:24:09.310
Notes:
The filming was delayed, and the episode
was shown with incorrect background and
other mistakes. The original episode is
included in the special feature.

00:24:07.440 --> 00:24:13.890
We'll return for sure.{Kanarazu koko he kaette kuru to}

00:24:09.310 --> 00:24:18.310
Notes:
This demanding episode took Tiger Production 50 days to make. They watched "Battle of Britain" and other war movies as references. It's an awesome episode with a load of combat scenes.

00:24:13.890 --> 00:24:21.340
Smile back at the people waving their hands.{te wo furu hito ni egao de kotae}

00:24:18.310 --> 00:24:29.310
Note:
The production took a long time, and the main episode couldn't edit short, so the recap part was substituted for the 80 second opening sequence.

00:24:18.310 --> 00:24:29.310
There was a scene of the Yamato taking off at the end of the episode with the text "...in 214 days" on the storyboard and recording script,
which they couldn't include.

00:24:22.640 --> 00:24:29.040
Leaving the Galactic System and
taking a long journey to Iscandar.{Ginga wo hanare Iscandar he harubaru nozomu}

00:24:29.040 --> 00:24:35.630
Space battleship Yamato!{Ucyuu senkan yamato}
